        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You take advantage of certain idiosyncrasies of teleportation magic to better hide your position. When you cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Dimensional Assault], you're affected by an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Invisibility] spell at the end of the teleport.</p>\n<p>You can choose not to make the Strike that is normally part of <em>dimensional assault</em>. If you do make the Strike, your <em>invisibility</em> ends after the Strike, as normal for <em>invisibility</em>.</p>"
        },
